my king to safety away from the center, and (2) activating my h1 rook. King safety is the highest priority in chess, especially in a position where central files are semi-open and my opponent has an active knight. After castling, I can address the e5 knight with moves like N: b1-c3 or f2-f4.\n\nAnswer: K: e1-g1"}
